sequenceDiagram
  title Logout flow with stateless token verification
    participant C as Client
    participant P as GET /protected/profile
    participant L as POST /auth/logout
    participant S as shared `supabase` client

    Note over S: .auth session: empty (login never called set_session)

    C->>P: Authorization: Bearer token
    P->>S: get_user(token)  [token passed directly]
    S-->>P: valid user (stateless check)
    P-->>C: 200 OK

    C->>L: Authorization: Bearer token
    L->>S: get_access_token() verifies token, then discards it
    L->>S: sign_out()  [no token arg - reads client session]
    S-->>L: AuthSessionMissingError
    L-->>C: 500 error